OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens next after major
OL,4,Afootbridge collapse?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to restore a famous landmark is
OL,7,Funder way after the popular footbridge
OL,8,Fcollapsed into a harbour.
OL,10,FPero's Bridge in Bristol has been
OL,11,Fclosed since August following a
OL,12,Fmechanical failure during a test lift.
OL,13,FLast month, the mid-section buckled and
OL,14,Fbecame partially submerged underwater.
OL,16,FA specialist recovery operation is now
OL,17,Funder way, and it is hoped the popular
OL,18,Fbridge will reopen by summer 2027.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
