OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens next after major
OL,4,Afootbridge collapse?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe work forms part of wider efforts to
OL,7,Fmaintain and improve Bristol Harbour,
OL,8,Fwith further upgrades totalling #7m
OL,9,Fplanned at different locations along
OL,10,Fthe waterfront.
